\"morning\", \"pricing_source\": \"provider_service\", \"pricing_snapshot\": null}], \"title\": \"Day 2:  Tansen → Rani Mahal\", \"result_id\": 340, \"altitude_m\": 500, \"created_at\": \"2026-09-09T06:19:37.000000Z\", \"day_number\": 2, \"updated_at\": \"2026-09-09T06:19:37.000000Z\", \"description\": \"From Tansen (1350m) to Rani Mahal (500m). Distance: 25 km, estimated time: 1.5 hrs. ⚠️ Long day – over 15km.\", \"distance_km\": \"25.00\", \"estimated_time_hours\": \"1.5\", \"overnight_waypoint_id\": 483}], \"breakdown\": [], \"total_cost\": 0}','{\"days\": 2, \"budget\": \"500.00\", \"interests\": [], \"destination\": \"Palpa (Tansen, Rani Mahal) Tour\", \"travel_style\": \"mid_range\"}','Hey There, I want best quotation for me pls send as soon as possible for the month of October 2026','completed','draft',NULL,NULL,'{\"quotation\": {\"greeting\": \"Dear Traveler, Thank you for choosing The Himalayan Journey for your upcoming 2-day exploration of Palpa. We are delighted to present a customized mid-range itinerary tailored specifically for your solo adventure.\", \"overview\": \"We have carefully designed a seamless 2-day tour covering Tansen and Rani Mahal, optimized for a single traveler. Our package includes private transportation, comfortable mid-range accommodations, all meals, a dedicated guide, and necessary permits, ensuring a hassle-free and enriching experience within your $500 budget.\", \"cost_breakdown\": {\"items\": [{\"total\": 130, \"per_person\": 130, \"description\": \"Private Vehicle & Fuel (2 Days)\"}, {\"total\": 95, \"per_person\": 95, \"description\": \"Accommodation (1 Night Tansen Mid-Range Lodge, 1 Night Rani Mahal Hotel)\"}, {\"total\": 65, \"per_person\": 65, \"description\": \"Meals (Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner for 2 Days)\"}, {\"total\": 110, \"per_person\": 110, \"description\": \"Professional Guide & Driver Fees\"}, {\"total\": 40, \"per_person\": 40, \"description\": \"Local Permits & Entry Fees\"}, {\"total\": 45, \"per_person\": 45,