range itinerary tailored specifically for your solo adventure.\n\nSERVICE OVERVIEW\n----------------\nWe have carefully designed a seamless 2-day tour covering Tansen and Rani Mahal, optimized for a single traveler. Our package includes private transportation, comfortable mid-range accommodations, all meals, a dedicated guide, and necessary permits, ensuring a hassle-free and enriching experience within your $500 budget.\n\nDAY-BY-DAY BREAKDOWN\n--------------------\nDay 1: Pokhara → Tansen\n\nDay 2: Tansen → Rani Mahal\n\nCOST BREAKDOWN\n--------------\nPrivate Vehicle & Fuel (2 Days) (Per Person: USD 130.00): USD 130.00\nAccommodation (1 Night Tansen Mid-Range Lodge, 1 Night Rani Mahal Hotel) (Per Person: USD 95.00): USD 95.00\nMeals (Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner for 2 Days) (Per Person: USD 65.00): USD 65.00\nProfessional Guide & Driver Fees (Per Person: USD 110.00): USD 110.00\nLocal Permits & Entry Fees (Per Person: USD 40.00): USD 40.00\nTravel Support & Contingency (Per Person: USD 45.00): USD 45.00\nGRAND TOTAL: USD 485.00\n\nTERMS & CONDITIONS\n-------------------\n1. Payment: 50% deposit required to confirm booking, balance due upon arrival.\n2. Cancellation: Full refund if cancelled 14 days prior, 50% refund if cancelled 7 days prior, no refund within 7 days.\n3. Inclusions: All listed transport, accommodation, meals, guide, and permits.\n4. Exclusions: Personal expenses, travel insurance, tips, and items not explicitly listed.\n5. Liability: The Himalayan Journey is not responsible for delays due to weather, road conditions, or force majeure.\n6. Modifications: Itinerary changes subject to availability and additional costs may apply.\n\nCONTACT US\n----------\nEmail: reservations@thehimalayanjourney.com\nPhone: +977-1-4567890\nWebsite: www.thehimalayanjourney.com\nAddress: N/A\n',NULL,'2026-09-09 00:38:45','2026-09-09 00:40:59',NULL),(3,NULL,'Shaista Regmi','regmiashish629@gmail.com','+9779761762036',14,342,'{\"days\": [{\"id\": 3034, \"items\": [{\"id\": 32