ooking, with the remaining balance due 30 days prior to departure.\n2. Cancellations made less than 14 days before the trek start date are non-refundable.\n3. Travelers must be in good physical health and possess valid travel insurance covering high-altitude trekking and emergency evacuation.\n4. The itinerary is subject to change due to weather conditions, trail accessibility, or safety concerns.\n5. All permits and government fees are included; however, international flights and personal expenses are not.\n6. The Himalayan Journey reserves the right to modify the route or services to ensure the safety and well-being of all participants.\n\nCONTACT US\n----------\nEmail: N/A\nPhone: N/A\nWebsite: N/A\nAddress: N/A\n','{\"quotation\": {\"discount\": 0, \"greeting\": \"Dear Traveler, Thank you for choosing The Himalayan Journey for your Annapurna Base Camp Trek. We are delighted to present this exclusive 9-day mid-range itinerary tailored specifically for you.\", \"overview\": \"We will provide a fully guided, mid-range trekking experience for 1 person across 9 days. Our package includes a professional trekking guide, porter support, comfortable mid-range lodge accommodations, three meals daily, all necessary trekking permits, and local transportation to and from the trailhead. This itinerary is carefully designed to align with your $1,000.00 budget while ensuring a safe, comfortable, and culturally immersive journey through the Annapurna region.\", \"special_notes\": \"\", \"cost_breakdown\": {\"items\": [{\"total\": 480, \"quantity\": 1, \"per_person\": 480, \"description\": \"Professional Trekking Guide (9 Days)\"}, {\"total\": 120, \"quantity\": 1, \"per_person\": 120, \"description\": \"Porter Services (9 Days)\"}, {\"total\": 200, \"quantity\": 1, \"per_person\": 200, \"description\": \"Mid-Range Lodge Accommodation (8 Nights)\"}, {\"total\": 180, \"quantity\": 1, \"per_person\": 180, \"description\": \"Daily Meals (Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner)\"}, {\"total\": 100